---
// Style guide section: Motion
// Markup ported word for word from the original case-study.html.
---
<section class="section_style-guide-motion" data-pane="style-guide" id="sg-motion">
      <div class="section-frame"><div class="section-card is-texture">
        <div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large">
          <div class="heading_component is-narrow" data-anim=""><span class="text-style-eyebrow text-color-brand">10</span><h2 class="heading-style-h3">Motion</h2><p class="text-color-secondary">Every animation is a Webflow Interaction, so timing and easing are edited in the Interactions panel. No animation lives in custom code.</p></div>
          <div class="card_list" data-anim-group="">
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">Fade up on scroll</p><p class="style-guide_code">Scroll into view · trigger element</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Each block rises 28px and fades in over 0.9s. Cards in a row start 80ms apart.</p></div>
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">Hero art enter</p><p class="style-guide_code">Scroll into view · outQuart 1.5s</p><p class="text-color-secondary">The photos and contract cards slide in from the sides as the page loads, one after the other.</p></div>
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">Bar grow on scroll</p><p class="style-guide_code">Scale X 0 → 1 · origin left</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Cost bars and report bars grow from the left in sequence.</p></div>
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">Image reveal on scroll</p><p class="style-guide_code">Opacity + scale 1.06 → 1</p><p class="text-color-secondary">The founder photo fades in from a slight zoom.</p></div>
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">Button hover</p><p class="style-guide_code">button_hover · class transition</p><p class="text-color-secondary">A red layer slides up behind the label on hover.</p></div>
            <div class="card_component"><p class="heading-style-h4">FAQ icon</p><p class="style-guide_code">Finsweet accordion · is-accordion-active</p><p class="text-color-secondary">The plus rotates 45° into a close icon, and the answer opens with a 400ms max-height transition.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div></div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
